{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6145.639956999999,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6597.744106,"text":"Aber nach dem Verlust des Wickets des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runs, wobei der Verlust von sieben ein großer"},{"kind":"audio","t":7214.9928660000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7216.401185000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7217.5217680000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7219.228813,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7220.923817000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7221.2711039999995,"samples":8916,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":12748.938578000001,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13382.50807,"text":"Normalerweise gibt es spezielle Angebote für Speisen, Getränke und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei guter Laune zu halten und sie dazu zu bewegen, länger vor Ort zu bleiben."},{"kind":"audio","t":14122.040999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14123.308005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":14124.898837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14126.50026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14128.244065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14129.855018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14130.404299,"samples":17108,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":19240.653678,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19607.251086999997,"text":"Del Potro hat den frühen Vorteil im zweiten Satz, aber dies führt zu einem Tie-Break."},{"kind":"audio","t":19982.642585999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19984.053345,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19985.738858999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19985.974113999997,"samples":9250,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":25296.864213999997,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25632.186647,"text":"Das Internet vereint Elemente der Massenkommunikation und der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"audio","t":26042.822363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26044.103328999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26045.740492999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26046.340314999998,"samples":18167,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":34446.244703,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":35079.472338,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle stimmt im Vergleich mittels Infrarotspektroskopie mit denen überein, die im Urin betroffener Haustiere gefunden wurden."},{"kind":"audio","t":35740.106651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35741.459529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35743.116853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35745.053622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":35746.694985,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":35748.090394,"samples":28421,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1090},{"kind":"input","t":36884.576229,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":36981.880829,"text":"FTIR."},{"kind":"audio","t":37069.813777999996,"samples":22012,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":42293.81632,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":42719.008382,"text":"Auf einigen Strecken setzen die größeren Unternehmen eigene Flugzeuge ein, aber für andere Strecken und kleinere Firmen gab es eine"},{"kind":"audio","t":43292.097014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43293.304379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43294.969822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43296.552305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43298.217028,"samples":32767,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"input","t":49515.539444,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":49927.459096,"text":"Einige Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie dazu neigen, zu zerfallen."},{"kind":"audio","t":50340.056652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50341.436499999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50343.080053,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":50343.987862,"samples":21232,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":53495.590572,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53749.983887999995,"text":"und ohne oder mit nur geringem Anstoß zu zerfallen."},{"kind":"audio","t":54013.891759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54015.269496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54015.528712,"samples":9417,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":60646.952437,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61341.290276,"text":"Im selben Monat überrollte ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug in Moshland die Start- und Landebahn und prallte gegen eine Mauer, wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"audio","t":62081.515189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62082.862086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62084.454629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62086.076482,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62087.679674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":62089.293457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62090.271467,"samples":21287,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":67221.118956,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67573.427695,"text":"Es sind fast alles Sandstrände mit sicherem Badewasser und die meisten bieten Schatten durch"},{"kind":"audio","t":67960.343628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67961.687996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67963.29882899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67963.793419,"samples":13708,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":70276.65132399999,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70434.882874,"text":"Pohican-Bäume."},{"kind":"audio","t":70537.18070499999,"samples":26192,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1040},{"kind":"input","t":76429.870056,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby,"},{"kind":"text","t":76801.24385299999,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby,"},{"kind":"audio","t":77329.747957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":77331.043323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77332.639606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77334.25579899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77335.28091,"samples":23015,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":80703.459288,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":81001.18979599999,"text":"Radsport, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1."},{"kind":"audio","t":81284.834908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81286.090234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81286.742737,"samples":15547,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":86521.362545,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86820.105083,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Nahen Ostens war das Haus nicht so wichtig."},{"kind":"audio","t":87100.751024,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87102.646993,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87102.908668,"samples":13597,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":93196.420792,"text":"The lake lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula."},{"kind":"text","t":93448.90437,"text":"Der See liegt 120 Kilometer nördlich von Peninsula."},{"kind":"audio","t":93792.061822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93793.329848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93794.958901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":93795.105984,"samples":334,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":98326.707327,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":98815.581855,"text":"Der Rotkohlsaft ändert seine Farbe je nachdem, wie sauer, basisch oder alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"audio","t":99301.18459599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99302.481402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99304.169477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":99305.84697099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99306.256549,"samples":11312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":105737.785673,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106326.005494,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 voll funktionsfähig sein, wenn die brasilianischen Zollkontrollstellen voraussichtlich fertiggestellt sind."},{"kind":"audio","t":106993.889054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106995.198411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106996.854635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106998.463757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107000.102471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":107001.739684,"samples":32043,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":113148.777663,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":113693.189531,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit an Ihren Händen wird mit den äußeren Schichten reagieren, was sich eigenartig anfühlen wird und eine Art Schale bildet."},{"kind":"audio","t":114232.409894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":114233.569657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114235.137079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114236.705501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114237.70540199999,"samples":22736,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":119602.384279,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":119892.034883,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Büro des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":120164.327913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120165.686521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120166.008768,"samples":11089,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":125298.947867,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125646.851546,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daru i Bayt wieder auf."},{"kind":"audio","t":125985.294973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125986.73334199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125988.147701,"samples":29758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"input","t":130412.582014,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130805.40658699999,"text":"und sie erhielt den Namen Casablanca von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte errichteten."},{"kind":"audio","t":131242.74132700003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131244.11143400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131245.753028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":131247.08347500002,"samples":27362,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":142833.878762,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":143580.58182700002,"text":"Er wurde vom stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, Wong Kan-seng, empfangen und erörterte Handels- und Terrorismusfragen mit dem singapurischen Premierminister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"audio","t":144455.923099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144457.70122500003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144459.020762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144460.66620500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144462.33540900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144464.203997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144465.59732600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144466.52514500002,"samples":23628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":154258.80403700002,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":154775.355489,"text":"Die Fissionsbombe funktioniert nach dem Prinzip, dass Energie benötigt wird, um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"audio","t":155423.854285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155425.17696200003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":155426.661192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155428.298386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155429.95752000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155431.019491,"samples":22569,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":162824.591404,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":163097.959246,"text":"Im Archipel und an den Seen benötigt man nicht unbedingt eine Yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":163432.471063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163433.81731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163435.18727800003,"samples":28086,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"close","t":174604.826409,"code":1005}]}